Nutrition
{{Main|Chia seed#Nutrition}}
Dried chia seeds are 6% water, 42% carbohydrates, 17% protein, and 31% fat (table). In a reference amount of {{convert|100|g}}, chia seeds supply 486 calories and are a rich source (20% or more of the Daily Value, DV) of several B vitamins and dietary minerals (table).
